":"lieut-data","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjMxNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/commits/4a93939359341050fbb511a038d6c32f3f42b5c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-17T20:29:46Z","email":"jesse.hallam@gmail.com","name":"Jesse Hallam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-17T20:29:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-63728: Add license load metric endpoint and UI indicator (#30700)\n\n* Add license load metric endpoint and UI indicator\n\nAdds an API endpoint to calculate and return license usage as a load metric, and displays this metric in the About dialog. The metric is calculated as (MAU/licensed users)*100.\n\nAdditionally:\n- Renamed function to be consistent with API endpoint name\n- Added proper i18n strings for error messages and UI elements\n\n* Fix TypeScript null check in about_build_modal.tsx\n\n* MM-63728: Update OpenAPI documentation for license load metric\n\nUpdate the OpenAPI documentation and code comments to correctly describe the license load metric calculation as using a multiplier of 1000 instead of percentage.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* MM-63728: Use float for license load metric calculation\n\nModify the license load metric calculation to use floats throughout the computation process while still returning an integer result. This maintains the existing API but improves the precision of the calculation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* improve tests manually\n\n* Update server/channels/api4/license_test.go\n\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>\n\n* Update server/channels/api4/license_test.go\n\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>","tree":{"sha":"be8ccf20156b95bc9c87dae3d811d9d0e8f36ba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/trees/be8ccf20156b95bc9c87dae3d811d9d0e8f36ba5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/commits/4a93939359341050fbb511a038d6c32f3f42b5c4","verification":{"payload":"tree be8ccf20156b95bc9c87dae3d811d9d0e8f36ba5\nparent 10bff401ee3dfc6300282f2ff2c9c4664ec3568a\nauthor Jesse Hallam <jesse.hallam@gmail.com> 1744921786 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744921786 -0300\n\nMM-63728: Add license load metric endpoint and UI indicator (#30700)\n\n* Add license load metric endpoint and UI indicator\n\nAdds an API endpoint to calculate and return license usage as a load metric, and displays this metric in the About dialog. The metric is calculated as (MAU/licensed users)*100.\n\nAdditionally:\n- Renamed function to be consistent with API endpoint name\n- Added proper i18n strings for error messages and UI elements\n\n* Fix TypeScript null check in about_build_modal.tsx\n\n* MM-63728: Update OpenAPI documentation for license load metric\n\nUpdate the OpenAPI documentation and code comments to correctly describe the license load metric calculation as using a multiplier of 1000 instead of percentage.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* MM-63728: Use float for license load metric calculation\n\nModify the license load metric calculation to use floats throughout the computation process while still returning an integer result. This maintains the existing API but improves the precision of the calculation.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* improve tests manually\n\n* Update server/channels/api4/license_test.go\n\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>\n\n* Update server/channels/api4/license_test.go\n\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Doug Lauder <wiggin77@warpmail.net>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoAWS6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXe4QAA/vwDP+S0gctUNHKhe8WpbZ\nfCyGn6zI0eU9FF+ptvWqSHWeTn44TBJQnLdf5CCciN1Ax955cFPElgr78EVNUhab\nVtNZ9TjzsbwzAVATs5QKoYFTm/ULFvMWchORnZPn79CkS/iNpzox+WHOjgPA/nY3\n/8CJI1BqYgtRA2vGYDN0ksURn1O8FSd8O0urnjTyL/K1WxZyxtZqjP1Okngt3ozR\nPO1gx7fuKjr46ARBaoNef1iBydAzs2Y6wqJY7ZBGJ1lreKUnG45qqW2bsdsXr1jy\nEad2AhhF4dcozRy2JuKDEnyro6PT0bCD/KnRMo5xRiO8kQXRPxSGcrWrR+RkS5q7\nLv5v5vaZ4JlaARjOpKGfgtmzHwT/8S+DCVTuk9bmsqWJDm2JLsNLjJSHMvKKFDTz\nJSu5xEc4C1557gn+6L5JOlu5nYt3Lw9D+l7RiPHcLZGzB2a4xBBn6CvJeVSaRHjB\nRxf6GPBRQe7ab/nQ4N3EbFNMRNcO0GQ1OEbpWZCHtKOW2WUZsHUgCHsDRBSB8zeZ\n4J2RCUm4Und5IuH6iqMSrKI7IaXBOT4l3FUdWWGYFioq2ZwuKPWOpW7H9Z7kyNxj\nqS4u7Pdzi7Uk+NZaq5LNdfWz1QptKfxfUQobIF4xF9Pd/ffqKugT72NXVJGH8Ap0\nGKtyHt0TwbvUz9V/T/hN\n=j5CI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-22T16:42:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-f