/api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/commits/3df7bfca88827f48c31b6ae7d20a99b785e81bba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-16T14:04:30Z","email":"miguel@mcrx.me","name":"Miguel de la Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-16T14:04:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improves validation and sanitization for CPA fields and values (#30694)\n\nThis change automatically removes options and sync attributes when\nsanitizing fields that don''t support them. As per values, it returns\nan error when the value for a text type field is longer than the 64\ncharacters limit we''re currently applying.\n\nThe PR fixes a bug on the create CPA field endpoint that was causing\nthe attrs of the CPAField not to be decoded correctly.\n\nCo-authored-by: Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@ctrlz.es>","tree":{"sha":"4317f940e0f79f1b510ae80aa9fa6b44c0b7130d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/trees/4317f940e0f79f1b510ae80aa9fa6b44c0b7130d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/commits/3df7bfca88827f48c31b6ae7d20a99b785e81bba","verification":{"payload":"tree 4317f940e0f79f1b510ae80aa9fa6b44c0b7130d\nparent 495a49b8965ea553e99cfdad7ec5f9919376cca3\nauthor Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@mcrx.me> 1744812270 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744812270 +0200\n\nImproves validation and sanitization for CPA fields and values (#30694)\n\nThis change automatically removes options and sync attributes when\nsanitizing fields that don''t support them. As per values, it returns\nan error when the value for a text type field is longer than the 64\ncharacters limit we''re currently applying.\n\nThe PR fixes a bug on the create CPA field endpoint that was causing\nthe attrs of the CPAField not to be decoded correctly.\n\nCo-authored-by: Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@ctrlz.es>","reason":"valid","signature":"---