15:41:59Z","email":"agnivade@yahoo.co.in","name":"Agniva De Sarker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-14T15:41:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-53739: replace store.NewErrNotFound with errors.Wrap in category queries (#30712)\n\nIt was a mistake to return ANY error as NewErrNotFound. Because this\ncan be a DB timeout, or any other network error.\n\nReturning NewErrNotFound would categorize it as 404, eventually printing\nthe error in the DEBUG level. Changing it to normal error fixes this.\n\nhttps://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-63739\n\n```release-note\nNONE\n```","tree":{"sha":"2bebff43120e57230ee228c8e805be66c9cfa287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/trees/2bebff43120e57230ee228c8e805be66c9cfa287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/commits/848bac2bae6203221149f4b25c14d0f7d7692284","verification":{"payload":"tree 2bebff43120e57230ee228c8e805be66c9cfa287\nparent ae971225a5c9c56d93245b2709f2b8e07f99f952\nauthor Agniva De Sarker <agnivade@yahoo.co.in> 1744645319 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744645319 +0530\n\nMM-53739: replace store.NewErrNotFound with errors.Wrap in category queries (#30712)\n\nIt was a mistake to return ANY error as NewErrNotFound. Because this\ncan be a DB timeout, or any other network error.\n\nReturning NewErrNotFound would categorize it as 404, eventually printing\nthe error in the DEBUG level. Changing it to normal error fixes this.\n\nhttps://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-63739\n\n```release-note\nNONE\n```","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn/SzHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgecQAAaroyR/bRh0ssUmFz9hOwkK\n36c9uvtZOzopEWC7Fyw37MZhkP45W0hCWuWNNyYIHzfoKAKGA61JhrLbrKyINg0M\nnkNffZXE726BX2ru4XEgLBIjePUP0qR89FjJu2RWsLlbb85pZKCwmK2qzxqiKvfW\n8FhZvtf+tzmwcCpUmDfINaF+pOedkX7bkrrzEHfYQpYscbBs4+ecHJwFFVhQkAyZ\nIsB2WXQrMmFO+F00tPvRDsQ0ZPqML860o6vw370N4xCQFGvHlpCvO+4wEAW6fVPw\nWKeVFfJr1H