rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mgdelacroix","id":223323,"login":"mgdelacroix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzMyMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mgdelacroix","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/commits/ca9fd45408edca8a42e741a83a2cbf3eceb1fd79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-10T17:22:05Z","email":"miguel@mcrx.me","name":"Miguel de la Cruz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-10T17:22:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Adds a mechanism to delete CPA values for a given user (#30330)\n\n* Adds a mechanism to delete CPA values for a given user\n\nThis requires improving the Property Value service to enable delete\nall values for a given target, so a new method was created that allows\nto delete filtering by targetType and targetID (required) and\noptionally for a specific groupID in case the caller wants to affect\nall values for a target (useful in case you remove a post for example\nand want to delete all values pointing to that post regardless of the\nfeature they belong to) or only those that belong to a specific\nfeature.\n\n* Fix property value tests\n\n* Fix after merge and update method name\n\n* Fix linter\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@ctrlz.es>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"d238a566f3e0323e5fe0286a3ef053a5c5794607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/trees/d238a566f3e0323e5fe0286a3ef053a5c5794607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manish-gitx/sst-mattermost/git/commits/ca9fd45408edca8a42e741a83a2cbf3eceb1fd79","verification":{"payload":"tree d238a566f3e0323e5fe0286a3ef053a5c5794607\nparent 3ab0da1648f67d3a25af524efe3eb84f0039890a\nauthor Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@mcrx.me> 1744305725 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744305725 +0200\n\nAdds a mechanism to delete CPA values for a given user (#30330)\n\n* Adds a mechanism to delete CPA values for a given user\n\nThis requires improving the Property Value service to enable delete\nall values for a given target, so a new method was created that allows\nto delete filtering by targetType and targetID (required) and\noptionally for a specific groupID in case the caller wants to affect\nall values for a target (useful in case you remove a post for example\nand want to delete all values pointing to that post regardless of the\nfeature they belong to) or only those that belong to a specific\nfeature.\n\n* Fix property value tests\n\n* Fix after merge and update method name\n\n* Fix linter\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Miguel de la Cruz <miguel@ctrlz.es>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn9/49CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd6cQAAK1cYMuUt5KAFBk0KMcFF5q\nwjUcpu6LRAJkRf11QZwZpjMtq63MkYixs6/V+SUsgCa6+nCmTrGOLAquPUDwm/qm\nSnubYrWc8Hd5TGmReou/WJw5YANSJRP9k0TPEup3himJLJFdkxLJM7fDpgLeOKoJ\neeH+vgAOy45zwJRs2HVYpwotGUcufIOBfjwSZDs4eCcNc49BdSVlDF1we5E469oL\nR5M0i1k3a8QNQkGTgzogkv3TrEDNxO7KYFizggKwmaSOnRySKHUwuTd0B5icq6nO\n57FQ8iOMrWQFtaNZbfHShrTCGQm3kursaYO5IWPdB6a4a4zqk7x/7Bo9IrzvOVDI\nVbD+NC4ehLn+Jfu10L5xS79uhmk8yMKIDr7VkbVNtaXqPtW7YnyO/kii5SB4Yij6\nlKAJfziKCeJK31bvS839hxckUw3nzJHKYLlcbciAXFYBaGvoPQvBZCVLtPdNgOXW\nzpKPDTMdkVF6je7oihsnchGyqdsPO3/esCIX2fI3fygy6aNDyX94qOSYN3gorNck\nKXZDuxzn5JT3ZKsP/FXjME3XDACcUwpx2