Z","email":"diamanti@mesagroup.eu","name":"Yuri Diamanti"},"message":"docs: aggiungi guidelines dev per industrializzazione\n\n- Sposta linea guida dev industrializzazione in docs/guidelines-dev/\n  come 01-processo-industrializzazione.md (prodotti standalone, target\n  architetturale generico al posto di riferimenti SEASYDE_AI)\n- Aggiunge 02-analisi-dominio-bounded-context.md con sessione di\n  discovery Event Storming lite e lettura del prototipo come\n  preparazione (non come conclusione)\n- Aggiunge release/rami-versioning-release.md con strategia main+tag\n  SemVer, plugin host-compatibility nel manifest e pipeline GHCR\n- Aggiunge tre skill in docs/guidelines-dev/skills/:\n  industrialization-kickoff per la review iniziale 24-48h,\n  bounded-context-discovery per la sessione di discovery,\n  changelog-generation per il changelog bilingue pre-tag\n- Aggiorna README SAT puntando alla nuova cartella\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f571e36891f2f498789562732e607af8c4a92cbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/f571e36891f2f498789562732e607af8c4a92cbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/700c60c70e9e5621bf88ef1c8748128e7347853f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274423778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diamanti-sg","id":274423778,"login":"diamanti-sg","node_id":"U_kgDOEFtf4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diamanti-sg/received_