,"tree":{"sha":"08079a07b50b3f193fd43d39732379d146434ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/08079a07b50b3f193fd43d39732379d146434ba1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/cebe313df74bd0d4c5d328e1fbc9f7c0aa6144f0","verification":{"payload":"tree 08079a07b50b3f193fd43d39732379d146434ba1\nparent d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777820095 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777820095 +0000\n\ndocs: update README + AGENTS.md for develop branch additions\n\n- Document --no-github / --github-org flags for ''mesa prototype''\n- Document MESA_AUTO_INSTALL safety knob\n- Add Linux as a first-class supported platform\n- Add MESA_QUIET / --quiet to the banner suppression list\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDo9pDxxT03aD78UXjTXF1SnpvdAdQuGBWp38oZTcaiwDRff+UcZSHcqGGTxr0CsE4\nfNGvY3CjGNZmPmm7dotw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-03T15:01:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/cebe313df74bd0d4c5d328e1fbc9f7c0aa6144f0","node_id":"C_kwDOOeahrNoAKGNlYmUzMTNkZjc0YmQwZDRjNWQzMjhlMWZiYzlmN2MwYWE2MTQ0ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4","sha":"d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4"}],"sha":"cebe313df74bd0d4c5d328e1fbc9f7c0aa6144f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/cebe313df74bd0d4c5d328e1fbc9f7c0aa6144f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:53:31Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:53:31Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"fix(prototype,setup): safety hardening on top of 9d5e\n\nprototype scaffold:\n- CORS uses an env-driven allowlist (CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS) instead of reflecting\n  the request Origin with credentials: true (which is effectively ''*'' with\n  cookies — the exact anti-pattern the security cursor rule warns against).\n  Same-origin requests (no Origin header) still work.\n- web page uses a relative URL (''/api/health'') in the browser; absolute URL\n  is only used for SSR fetches that need a host.\n\nsetup / tool-checker:\n- runInstallCommand shell fallback (curl|bash, sudo apt-get) is now opt-in\n  for non-interactive runs. ''mesa init -y'' on a fresh box no longer pipes\n  arbitrary install scripts into bash without user consent.\n- Behavior matrix:\n    Interactive TTY:      typed installer + shell fallback (as before).\n    Non-interactive:      typed installer only; shell fallback requires\n                          MESA_AUTO_INSTALL=1.\n    MESA_AUTO_INSTALL=0:  shell fallback disabled in all cases.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"35cd8faedb0c28ed491588a82b84873fd67f135e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/35cd8faedb0c28ed491588a82b84873fd67f135e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 35cd8faedb0c28ed491588a82b84873fd67f135e\nparent dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777820011 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777820011 +0000\n\nfix(prototype,setup): safety hardening on top of 9d5e\n\nprototype scaffold:\n- CORS uses an env-driven allowlist (CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS) instead of reflecting\n  the request Origin with credentials: true (which is effectively ''*'' with\n  cookies — the exact anti-pattern the security cursor rule warns against).\n  Same-origin requests (no Origin header) still work.\n- web page uses a relative URL (''/api/health'') in the browser; absolute URL\n  is only used for SSR fetches that need a host.\n\nsetup / tool-checker:\n- runInstallCommand shell fallback (curl|bash, sudo apt-get) is now opt-in\n  for non-interactive runs. ''mesa init -y'' on a fresh box no longer pipes\n  arbitrary install scripts into bash without user consent.\n- Behavior matrix:\n    Interactive TTY:      typed installer + shell fallback (as before).\n    Non-interactive:      typed installer only; shell fallback requires\n                          MESA_AUTO_INSTALL=1.\n    MESA_AUTO_INSTALL=0:  shell fallback disabled in all cases.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKxpre+VbKyUeBkbQkzUPH4B/WHvtXGuBcU6hGqwYXm7AlS3bAlShG5ytY2aHT/Z9K\nMWbfLUF0//zyt/8mtaxgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-03T15:01:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4","node_id":"C_kwDOOeahrNoAKGQ0NDc0ZjZmYWJlOWQ3MzBjNGNjODBhMzkxNTQxNTE5MDRlYmE2YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3","sha":"dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3"}],"sha":"d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/d4474f6fabe9d730c4cc80a39154151904eba6c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:51:23Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:51:23Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"fix(prototype): make CI + vercel.json lockfile-agnostic + fix vercel-json import\n\nCherry-picks the lesson from cursor/prototype-command-8797: scaffolded repos\nhave no committed pnpm-lock.yaml on first push, so ''pnpm install --frozen-lockfile''\nfails the very first deploy.\n\nChanges:\n- ci.yml, deploy.yml (preview + production jobs), and vercel.json now use\n  ''pnpm install'' instead of ''pnpm install --frozen-lockfile''.\n- Each location has a TODO-style comment telling the user to switch to a frozen\n  install once pnpm-lock.yaml is committed.\n- Adds a regression test that asserts no ''--frozen-lockfile'' appears in the\n  scaffolded CI + vercel.json (port of the 8797 ''lockfile-agnostic'' assertion).\n- Fixes a broken type import path in src/templates/prototype/vercel-json.ts\n  (was ''../../../generators'' but the file is only 2 levels deep, not 3).\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"40d1cf4b1c828615e89c36c8fb28d347e74a229f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/40d1cf4b1c828615e89c36c8fb28d347e74a229f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3","verification":{"payload":"tree 40d1cf4b1c828615e89c36c8fb28d347e74a229f\nparent 14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777819883 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777819883 +0000\n\nfix(prototype): make CI + vercel.json lockfile-agnostic + fix vercel-json import\n\nCherry-picks the lesson from cursor/prototype-command-8797: scaffolded repos\nhave no committed pnpm-lock.yaml on first push, so ''pnpm install --frozen-lockfile''\nfails the very first deploy.\n\nChanges:\n- ci.yml, deploy.yml (preview + production jobs), and vercel.json now use\n  ''pnpm install'' instead of ''pnpm install --frozen-lockfile''.\n- Each location has a TODO-style comment telling the user to switch to a frozen\n  install once pnpm-lock.yaml is committed.\n- Adds a regression test that asserts no ''--frozen-lockfile'' appears in the\n  scaffolded CI + vercel.json (port of the 8797 ''lockfile-agnostic'' assertion).\n- Fixes a broken type import path in src/templates/prototype/vercel-json.ts\n  (was ''../../../generators'' but the file is only 2 levels deep, not 3).\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQM84a7nGy6FCunvBpzBHrLHRb3ch3xQn65l1x3XYQvQJopyTaSGp+LzW35v2+GZf8/\n8mFm1GhOrBdh1OtEC4sgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-03T15:01:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3","node_id":"C_kwDOOeahrNoAKGRjMmRkN2NkOGU5YjJhYmNlNDY3MGNiZGU1M2U5ZjM0NGZlOWMxYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commit/14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db","sha":"14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db"}],"sha":"dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/dc2dd7cd8e9b2abce4670cbde53e9f344fe9c1b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:47:43Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:47:43Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"feat(prototype): add optional github repo creation via gh CLI\n\nCherry-picks the gh repo create flow from cursor/mesa-prototype-command-702a\nand wires it into ''mesa prototype'' with --no-github / --github-org flags.\n\nBehavior:\n- Skipped silently when stdin is non-TTY or ''gh'' is not on PATH (with hint).\n- When interactive + gh available: confirm prompt, then prompts for org\n  (default = MESA_GITHUB_ORG env var, then ''mesagroup'').\n- ''gh repo create <org>/<name> --private --source . --push'' run from project dir.\n- Failures are non-fatal — caller continues with a warning.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfaf32c7bdceadce7f877e95fe07276e7e89c019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/bfaf32c7bdceadce7f877e95fe07276e7e89c019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/14e655c633852b4f519a0a88964c912a441d61db","verification":{"payload":"tree bfaf32c7bdceadce7f877e95fe07276e7e89c019\nparent 8074b435c92bb69325e4c9b2ec01f283a9460f6a\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777819663 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1777819663 +0000\n\nfeat(prototype): add optional github repo creation via gh CLI\n\nCherry-picks the gh repo create flow from cursor/mesa-prototype-command-702a\nand wires it into ''mesa prototype'' with --no-github / --github-org flags.\n\nBehavior:\n- Skipped silently when stdin is non-TTY or ''gh'' is not on PATH (with hint).\n- When interactive + gh available: confirm prompt, then prompts for org\n  (default = MESA_GITHUB_ORG env var, then ''mesagroup'').\n- ''gh repo create <org>/<name> --private --source . --push'' run from project dir.\n- Failures are non-fatal — caller continues with a warning.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luca Bianchi <aletheia@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGqi9PtTAvaBw+nS3DUtOaIV+V4ztqaa7YhOAkMCE4ME0k3m3eOVeJQsetlFaPhAl