sers.noreply.github.com","name":"Luca Bianchi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T18:54:50Z","email":"653823+aletheia@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luca Bianchi"},"message":"🐛 Fix Aspire TypeScript AppHost runtime errors in scaffolded projects\n\n- Add \"type\": \"module\" to generated package.json (fixes top-level await CJS error)\n- Add vscode-jsonrpc ^8.2.0 dependency (required by Aspire SDK transport)\n- Fix aspire.config.json to match official 13.2 format (appHost.path, language, sdk, packages)\n- Include database-specific Aspire packages in config (SqlServer/PostgreSQL/MongoDB)\n- Run npm install + aspire add <db> during scaffold to generate .modules/ SDK\n- Add MESA_SKIP_INSTALL env guard so tests skip external commands\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a296e24a33b7cf5dc7dfe154984b049e3c2dbeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/5a296e24a33b7cf5dc7dfe154984b049e3c2dbeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/3fe2b99d7908ed60e9f12507855ecfc7874b74ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/653823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aletheia","id":653823,"login":"aletheia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzgyMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip