Z","email":"653823+aletheia@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luca Bianchi"},"message":"✨ Update to Aspire 13.2 TypeScript AppHost API and bump to v1.2.0\n\n- Fix apphost.ts template: use createBuilder() from .modules/aspire.js\n  (replaces non-existent @aspire/hosting package)\n- Handle database type (SQL Server/PostgreSQL/MongoDB) in apphost\n- Handle standalone Next.js full-stack (no ./backend directory)\n- Update Aspire install to standalone binary (aspire.dev/install.sh)\n- Mark .NET SDK as optional (no longer needed for TS app hosts)\n- Add stack comparison table and standalone docs to README\n- Bump version to 1.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8308a357fb9d23e51fc6473fe4525f68408f8f31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/8308a357fb9d23e51fc6473fe4525f68408f8f31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/25365eb22117223c516024f88d6d2515748ab81a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/653823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aletheia","id":653823,"login":"aletheia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzgyMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia","