jY1MzgyMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aletheia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/commits/6fd599cfbdd94dbb67da49de531eeb4b1031b50c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T21:34:35Z","email":"653823+aletheia@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luca Bianchi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T21:34:35Z","email":"653823+aletheia@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luca Bianchi"},"message":"✨ Add Standalone App (PoC) project type with configurable stack\n\nAdd a third project type to mesa-cli for scaffolding standalone applications\n(not MESAPPA plugins) with flexible database, frontend, and deployment options.\n\nPrompt flow: accept defaults (Next.js + SQL Server + Vercel) or customise:\n- Database: SQL Server, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB (local Docker / Atlas cloud)\n- Frontend: Next.js full-stack (API routes), Angular 16, or React + Vite\n- Deployment: Vercel or Azure (via Aspire + azd)\n\nNext.js = single full-stack app; Angular/Vite = monorepo with Express backend.\nAspire orchestrates local dev (DB + app), skipped for MongoDB Atlas.\nGitHub Actions CI/CD included for both Vercel and Azure deploy targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"026a2fbb19943f9882c8c7ee007060f78781334a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/trees/026a2fbb19943f9882c8c7ee007060f78781334a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mesagroup/mesa-cli/git/commits/6fd599cfbdd94dbb67da49de531eeb4b1031b50c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatur