mail":"kazuyukishimizu@me.com","name":"kazuyuki@mobile"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T12:03:47Z","email":"kazuyukishimizu@me.com","name":"kazuyuki@mobile"},"message":"fix(css): route .background() to background shorthand, add .backgroundColor()\n\nBUG-1 修正。.background() fluent が radial-gradient 等の shorthand 値を\nbackground-color: に誤出力していた問題を解消する。\n\n- CSSPropertyKey に background キー追加（146→147プロパティ）\n- CSSBackground.setBackground(string | BackgroundOptions) を追加\n  string → background: ショートハンド出力\n  object → 個別 background-* プロパティ出力\n- HtmlTag.background(v) を新 setter にルーティング\n- HtmlTag.backgroundColor(v) を新設（色専用 background-color: 出力）\n- examples/mvp-demo.ts: body の .background(theme.bg) を .backgroundColor に変更\n  （globalCss 側の background-image/attachment をショートハンドで reset しないため）\n- README.md / README.ja.md の Fluent API 一覧に .backgroundColor() 追記\n- 既存テストを新仕様に更新、gradient/shorthand object の新規テスト追加\n\n破壊的変更: .background(''#fff'') の出力が background-color: → background: に変化\n（CSS 的には等価）\n\n全 2858 テスト PASS、tsc --noEmit clean。","tree":{"sha":"520d7ded687b09d00e148d0d584c167d76940caf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/object-zaseeta/DraftOle/git/trees/520d7ded687b09d00e148d0d584c167d76940caf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/object-zaseeta/DraftOle/git/commits/cc32f5677283fba1f9c9c300ec2d26a55151b675","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479558?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/object-kazu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/object-kazu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/object-kazu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/object-kazu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/object-kazu","id":479558,"login":"object-kazu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTU1OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/object-kazu/